tems, receipts, or content with attachments you need). Messages that also have other labels will also be moved to Trash. If you want to preserve any starred or important newsletters, they need to be excluded beforehand.\n\nAlternative options (pick one if you prefer):\nA) Remove the \"Newsletters\" label from matching messages (they remain in All Mail/search) — reversible at any time by reapplying the label.\nB) Archive matching messages (keeps them in All Mail; note: archiving does not remove labels, so they’d still show under Newsletters).\nC) Delete only messages older than X months/years — specify a different cutoff (e.g., 18 months).\nD) Exclude starred messages and/or messages from specific senders (list them).\n\nI don’t have a count of how many messages would be affected. If you want that before deleting, I can first list the number and example subjects instead of acting.\n\nPlease confirm exactly:\n1) Action to take (Delete / Remove label / Archive / Other — specify).\n2) Cutoff date (keep default “older than 1 year → before 2025-09-05” or give a different date).\n3) Exclude starred messages? Exclude any senders? (If yes, list senders or say “exclude starred”.)\n4) Confirm the label name is exactly \"Newsletters\" and that this is the correct Gmail account.\n5) If you want me to first show how many messages would be affected (recommended), say “Show count first”; otherwise say “Proceed”.\n\nOnce you confirm these details, I will proceed.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0b619ad6822bfef2016a9c9b8f6d4087d09e606adbab7cad13","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"in_memory","reasoning":{"context":"current_turn","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","status":"completed","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium